---Checkout session data retrieved using the client secret.
---@class polar.CheckoutPublic
---@field id string The ID of the object.
---@field created_at string Creation timestamp of the object.
---@field modified_at string|distilled.Null Last modification timestamp of the object.
---@field custom_field_data? polar.CheckoutPublicCustomFieldDataMap Key-value object storing custom field values.
---@field payment_processor polar.PaymentProcessor Payment processor used.
---@field status polar.CheckoutStatus Status of the checkout session. - Open: the checkout session was opened. - Expired: the checkout session was expired and is no more accessible. - Confirmed: the user on the checkout session clicked Pay. This is not indicative of the payment's success status. - Failed: the checkout definitely failed for technical reasons and cannot be retried. In most cases, this state is never reached. - Succeeded: the payment on the checkout was performed successfully.
---@field client_secret distilled.Secret Client secret used to update and complete the checkout session from the client.
---@field url string URL where the customer can access the checkout session.
---@field expires_at string Expiration date and time of the checkout session.
---@field success_url string URL where the customer will be redirected after a successful payment.
---@field return_url string|distilled.Null When set, a back button will be shown in the checkout to return to this URL.
---@field embed_origin string|distilled.Null When checkout is embedded, represents the Origin of the page embedding the checkout. Used as a security measure to send messages only to the embedding page.
---@field amount number Amount in cents, before discounts and taxes.
---@field seats? number|distilled.Null Predefined number of seats (works with seat-based pricing only)
---@field min_seats? number|distilled.Null Minimum number of seats (works with seat-based pricing only)
---@field max_seats? number|distilled.Null Maximum number of seats (works with seat-based pricing only)
---@field units number|distilled.Null Predefined number of units (works with unit-based pricing only)
---@field min_units number|distilled.Null Minimum number of units (works with unit-based pricing only)
---@field max_units number|distilled.Null Maximum number of units (works with unit-based pricing only)
---@field discount_amount number Discount amount in cents.
---@field net_amount number Amount in cents, after discounts but before taxes.
---@field tax_amount number|distilled.Null Sales tax amount in cents. If `null`, it means there is no enough information yet to calculate it.
---@field tax_behavior polar.TaxBehavior|distilled.Null Tax behavior of the checkout. `inclusive` means the price includes tax, `exclusive` means tax is added on top. If `null`, tax is not yet calculated.
---@field total_amount number Amount in cents, after discounts and taxes.
---@field currency string Currency code of the checkout session.
---@field allow_trial boolean|distilled.Null Whether to enable the trial period for the checkout session. If `false`, the trial period will be disabled, even if the selected product has a trial configured.
---@field active_trial_interval polar.TrialInterval|distilled.Null Interval unit of the trial period, if any. This value is either set from the checkout, if `trial_interval` is set, or from the selected product.
---@field active_trial_interval_count number|distilled.Null Number of interval units of the trial period, if any. This value is either set from the checkout, if `trial_interval_count` is set, or from the selected product.
---@field trial_end string|distilled.Null End date and time of the trial period, if any.
---@field organization_id string ID of the organization owning the checkout session.
---@field product_id string|distilled.Null ID of the product to checkout.
---@field discount_id string|distilled.Null ID of the discount applied to the checkout.
---@field allow_discount_codes boolean Whether to allow the customer to apply discount codes. If you apply a discount through `discount_id`, it'll still be applied, but the customer won't be able to change it.
---@field require_billing_address boolean Whether to require the customer to fill their full billing address, instead of just the country. Customers in the US will always be required to fill their full address, regardless of this setting. If you preset the billing address, this setting will be automatically set to `true`.
---@field is_discount_applicable boolean Whether the discount is applicable to the checkout. Typically, free and custom prices are not discountable.
---@field is_free_product_price boolean Whether the product price is free, regardless of discounts.
---@field is_payment_required boolean Whether the checkout requires payment, e.g. in case of free products or discounts that cover the total amount.
---@field is_payment_setup_required boolean Whether the checkout requires setting up a payment method, regardless of the amount, e.g. subscriptions that have first free cycles.
---@field is_payment_form_required boolean Whether the checkout requires a payment form, whether because of a payment or payment method setup.
---@field customer_id string|distilled.Null
---@field is_business_customer boolean Whether the customer is a business or an individual. If `true`, the customer will be required to fill their full billing address and billing name.
---@field customer_name string|distilled.Null Name of the customer.
---@field customer_email string|distilled.Null Email address of the customer.
---@field customer_ip_address string|distilled.Null
---@field customer_billing_name string|distilled.Null
---@field customer_billing_address polar.Address|distilled.Null
---@field customer_tax_id string|distilled.Null
---@field locale? string|distilled.Null
---@field payment_method_type string|distilled.Null Payment method type selected by the customer in the checkout form, e.g. `card`, `apple_pay` or `upi`.
---@field payment_processor_metadata polar.CheckoutPublicPaymentProcessorMetadataMap
---@field billing_address_fields polar.CheckoutBillingAddressFields Determine which billing address fields should be disabled, optional or required in the checkout form.
---@field products polar.CheckoutPublicProductsList List of products available to select.
---@field product polar.CheckoutProduct|distilled.Null Product selected to checkout.
---@field product_price polar.ProductPrice|distilled.Null Price of the selected product.
---@field prices polar.CheckoutPublicPricesMap|distilled.Null Mapping of product IDs to their list of prices.
---@field discount polar.CheckoutPublicDiscount|distilled.Null
---@field organization polar.CheckoutOrganization
---@field attached_custom_fields polar.CheckoutPublicAttachedCustomFieldsList|distilled.Null

