---@class polar.MetersUpdateRequest
---@field id string The meter ID.
---@field external_id? string|distilled.Null An ID from your own system to reference this resource. It must be unique within the organization for this type of resource.
---@field metadata? polar.MetersUpdateRequestMetadataMap Key-value object allowing you to store additional information. The key must be a string with a maximum length of **40 characters**. The value must be either: * A string with a maximum length of **500 characters** * An integer * A floating-point number * A boolean You can store up to **50 key-value pairs**.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null The name of the meter. Will be shown on customer's invoices and usage.
---@field unit? polar.MeterUnit|string|distilled.Null The unit of the meter.
---@field custom_label? string|distilled.Null The label for the custom unit. Required when unit is 'custom'.
---@field custom_multiplier? number|distilled.Null The multiplier to convert from base unit to display scale. Required when unit is 'custom'.
---@field filter? polar.Filter|distilled.Null The filter to apply on events that'll be used to calculate the meter.
---@field aggregation? polar.MetersUpdateRequestAggregation|distilled.Null The aggregation to apply on the filtered events to calculate the meter.
---@field is_archived? boolean|distilled.Null Whether the meter is archived. Archived meters are no longer used for billing.

---@alias polar.MetersUpdateRequestAggregation polar.CountAggregation|polar.PropertyAggregation|polar.UniqueAggregation

---Key-value object allowing you to store additional information.
---
---The key must be a string with a maximum length of **40 characters**.
---The value must be either:
---
---* A string with a maximum length of **500 characters**
---* An integer
---* A floating-point number
---* A boolean
---
---You can store up to **50 key-value pairs**.
---@alias polar.MetersUpdateRequestMetadataMap { [string]: polar.MetersUpdateRequestMetadataValue }

---@alias polar.MetersUpdateRequestMetadataValue string|number|number|boolean

